    {
      "title_cn": "工信部政策解读：加强智能体终端设备进网管理",
      "title_en": "MIIT policy interpretation: strengthening network access management for agent terminal devices",
      "title_original": "《关于加强智能体终端设备进网管理的通知》政策解读",
      "source": "工业和信息化部",
      "published_at": "2026-11-06T09:47:00+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://wap.miit.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_7ebf90533ca74af78542c70d3adaabb9.html",
      "category": "policy",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "what_happened": "工业和信息化部于2026年11月6日发布《关于加强智能体终端设备进网管理的通知》政策解读。智能体终端指预置智能体的手机、平板、可穿戴设备等。通知主要包括四方面：推动智能体适配、加强智能体终端进网管理、强化现网升级管理、健全分发管理机制。",
      "what_happened_en": "MIIT issued a policy interpretation, published 2026-11-06, of its notice on agent terminal devices—phones, tablets and wearables with preinstalled agents. It covers four areas: agent adaptation, network access management, OTA upgrade management, and distribution management.",
      "why_it_matters": "该通知旨在建立适配验证、进网检测、现网升级、分发管理全链条制度体系，约束智能体强制调用、不兼容安装等行为，落实终端用户使用智能体的知情权、选择权。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "The notice aims to build a full-chain system for adaptation verification, network access testing, OTA upgrades and distribution, constrain forced agent calls and incompatible installs, and protect users' right to know and choose.",
      "importance_score": 65,
      "supply_level": 1,
      "section": "explore",
      "ranking_score": 69.0,
      "content_type": "news",
