    {
      "title_cn": "工业和信息化部办公厅关于加强智能体终端设备进网管理的通知",
      "title_en": "MIIT General Office notice on strengthening network access management for agent terminal devices",
      "title_original": "工业和信息化部办公厅关于加强智能体终端设备进网管理的通知",
      "source": "工业和信息化部",
      "published_at": "2026-11-06T09:47:00+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://wap.miit.gov.cn/zwgk/zcwj/wjfb/tz/art/2026/art_bc3e3e4c3fa84ca2a1c14ff1067ab844.html",
      "category": "policy",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "what_happened": "工业和信息化部办公厅印发工信厅信管〔2026〕42号通知，成文日期2026年10月24日，发布日期2026年11月6日。预置智能体的手机、平板、可穿戴设备须在进网检测中开展智能体适配验证；通过OTA开展现网升级须提交方案，经专家评估、征求意见后方可向用户提供服务。",
      "what_happened_en": "MIIT General Office document No. 42 (2026), dated 2026-10-24 and published 2026-11-06, requires agent adaptation verification in network access testing for phones, tablets and wearables with preinstalled agents, and requires OTA upgrade plans to be submitted and expert-evaluated before service.",
      "why_it_matters": "该通知为智能体终端建立了覆盖适配、进网、现网升级和分发的全链条要求。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "The notice sets full-chain requirements covering agent adaptation, network access, OTA upgrades and distribution for agent terminal devices.",
