      "category": "internet",
      "original_language": "en",
      "what_happened": "Cloudflare 阐述了 TLS 等认证密钥协商协议中后量子密码的优先事项，并说明 Privacy Pass 如何发放与客户端不可关联的令牌，从而在不使用验证码或指纹识别的情况下限制滥用。",
      "what_happened_en": "Cloudflare described priorities for post-quantum cryptography in authenticated key-agreement protocols such as TLS, and how Privacy Pass issues tokens unlinkable to the client to limit abuse without CAPTCHAs or fingerprinting.",
      "why_it_matters": "若后量子基础组件不到位，一旦密码学相关量子计算机投入使用，安全的互联网通信将无法实现。",
